    <div class="cover-meta">
        <p><b>Comprehensive Major Technical Project Report</b></p>
        <p>An Automated Multi-Criteria Decision-Support System for Greenfield Highway and Expressway Planning</p>
        <br><br>
        <p><b>Technology Stack:</b> Java 25 &bull; Spring Boot &bull; React &bull; Leaflet &bull; ISRO Bhuvan GIS &bull; OpenStreetMap</p>
