<p><b>Vehicle Operating Cost (VOC) Savings (IRC:SP:30):</b> An estimated <b>₹142.5 Crore saved annually</b> across commercial freight and passenger traffic compared to legacy congested routes.<br>
<b>Travel Time Valuation:</b> Transit time between Kohora Chariali and Diphu reduced from 185 min to 58 min, generating <b>₹88.6 Crore annual monetized time savings</b>.<br>
<b>Economic Viability:</b> Over a 30-year lifecycle at a 12% discount rate, the alignment achieves a <b>Benefit-Cost Ratio (BCR) of 1.84</b> and an <b>Economic Internal Rate of Return (EIRR) of 16.8%</b>.</p>

